
   IMPORTANT UPGRADE INSTRUCTIONS
   ======================================================================

   Upgrading from v2.0x
   --------------------
      If you are upgrading from v2.0 or v2.01 then please run both the
      UPGRADE1.EXE and UPGRADE2.EXE files to upgrade to OLMS 2000.

   Upgrading from v2.5x/Shareware
   ------------------------------
      If you are upgrading from the shareware version v2.5x then please
      run just UPGRADE2.EXE to upgrade to OLMS 2000.

   Upgrading from v2.5x/Professional
   ---------------------------------
     If you are upgrading from the profession version of v2.5x then you
     do not have to run any upgrade files.

